flowchart TD
  Start[Role response needed] --> Primary[Primary provider]
  Primary --> Valid{Valid structured response?}
  Valid -->|yes| Normalize[Normalize and persist]
  Valid -->|no| Fallback{AnythingLLM fallback available?}
  Fallback -->|yes| Anything[AnythingLLM fallback]
  Anything --> FallbackValid{Valid?}
  FallbackValid -->|yes| Normalize
  FallbackValid -->|no| Warning[Persist warning]
  Fallback -->|no| Warning
  Warning --> Verdict[Use remaining usable evidence]
  Normalize --> Verdict
  Verdict --> UI[Readable brief and resilience notice]
